{
  "id": "lolin-s2-mini",
  "name": "LOLIN S2 Mini",
  "baseChip": "esp32s2",
  "pcb": "black",
  "notes": [
    "LOLIN (WEMOS) S2 Mini: 34.3 x 25.4 mm bare ESP32-S2FN4R2 (4 MB flash, 2 MB PSRAM), USB-C. The outer pin rows match the D1 mini footprint (shields fit); the inner rows are a second set of through-hole pads, drawn as the inboard strip here.",
    "Native USB only, no serial bridge: hold BOOT (GPIO0, not broken out) and tap RST for download mode. Arduino defaults: TX=39, RX=37 (native UART0 GPIO43/44 is not broken out), SDA=33, SCL=35, SPI SCK=7 / MISO=9 / MOSI=11 / SS=12."
  ],
